# Search-tool exclusions (ripgrep and tools built on it read this file; git does not).
# Protected held-out inputs must not appear in ad-hoc search output. The files stay
# tracked and remain covered by the live-gate fingerprint and source archives, which
# read bytes mechanically and do not use this file. Bypass only with an explicit
# --no-ignore and a recorded reason; never search evaluator-side labels.
configs/datasets/vulngym_heldout_inputs*.json
**/source/configs/datasets/vulngym_heldout_inputs*.json
